The ATT&CK Data Model
---------------------

The schema follows the ATT&CK Data Model (ADM), which defines ATT&CK's
STIX extensions, at release v4.11.7 of
https://github.com/mitre-attack/attack-data-model (commit
99558689a7efecbb9eec74b1b1a5b6fbfad25f8a), licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0. No code or text of the ADM is copied here.

